/----------
/
/ Display the string:
/
/	<more...> or <no more>
/
/----------

DISMORE,
	XX
	CIFTXT
	JMS I	(CALIOA)
DISMO1,		.-.		/ <more...> or <no more>
		LABRKT		/ left angle bracket
		RABRKT		/ right  "      "
	JMP I	DISMORE


